❯ We are building a POC called "Expense Receipt Processor" .                    
                                                                                
  Problem: employees upload receipt images/PDFs; the system extracts merchant,  
  date, tax,                                                                    
  subtotal, total, currency; suggests an expense category; the employee         
  reviews/corrects and                                                          
  submits; admin/finance reviews submitted receipts, manages categories, and    
  views summaries.                                                              
                                                                                
  Stack (fixed): FastAPI (Python 3.11+), SQLite via SQLAlchemy 2.0 + Alembic,   
  Pydantic v2,                                                                  
  React 18 + TypeScript + Vite. Monorepo layout:                                
    /backend  (src-layout: backend/src/app/..., backend/tests/...)              
    /frontend (Vite React TS)                                                   
    /docs                                                                       
    /.claude  (rules, skills, agents, hooks)                                    
                                                                                
